(5273981, 767500, 102811, '<td valign="top">An amazing capture. I hope everyone was ok? A 9 from me. Minor point I wonder how it would have looked with a level horizon/runway. Maybe it would have given the impression of being even more dramatic because the tail would have been higher and the angle steeper. Just a thought and a once in a lifetime shot IMHO. Well done. <b>EDIT - I showed this to my wife and she immediately pointed out it was a RC plane? If so, how silly do I feel! Even so, great shot and still a 9.</b></td>', 'An amazing capture. I hope everyone was ok? A 9 from me. Minor point I wonder how it would have looked with a level horizon/runway. Maybe it would have given the impression of being even more dramatic because the tail would have been higher and the angle steeper. Just a thought and a once in a lifetime shot IMHO. Well done. EDIT - I showed this to my wife and she immediately pointed out it was a RC plane? If so, how silly do I feel! Even so, great shot and still a 9.', '2009-02-25 08:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
