(5274850, 767213, 84438, '<td valign="top">Great action shot.  I understand that the ball should be in frame to give context, but I''m not really getting a sense of height because of the framing.  Still nice though.</td>', 'Great action shot.  I understand that the ball should be in frame to give context, but I''m not really getting a sense of height because of the framing.  Still nice though.', '2009-02-25 16:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
