(5274858, 767957, 84438, '<td valign="top">Nice, sharp image.  These cars are either stopped, or you used such a fast shutter speed to get the tires perfectly frozen.  Either way, I''m not sure if I''m getting much of a sense of ''action''.</td>', 'Nice, sharp image.  These cars are either stopped, or you used such a fast shutter speed to get the tires perfectly frozen.  Either way, I''m not sure if I''m getting much of a sense of ''action''.', '2009-02-25 17:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
