(5276687, 767639, 70202, '<td valign="top">I like the shot but this cyclist just doesn''t help it be believable she is much to relaxed to give off that intense feeling of speed that it seems you are going for. Here is what ruins it for me... relaxed arms and finger, head looking up and tennis shoes, I mean who really is going super fast on a bike that lets you wear tennis shoes?  With different model posing this could score much higher.</td>', 'I like the shot but this cyclist just doesn''t help it be believable she is much to relaxed to give off that intense feeling of speed that it seems you are going for. Here is what ruins it for me... relaxed arms and finger, head looking up and tennis shoes, I mean who really is going super fast on a bike that lets you wear tennis shoes?  With different model posing this could score much higher.', '2009-02-26 18:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
