(5277118, 767548, 96881, '<td valign="top">Love the effect of this as always.  Must of made quite a mess trying to get the exact right shot.  I think the crop maybe is a little close on top and bottom as we lose the extremes of the splash</td>', 'Love the effect of this as always.  Must of made quite a mess trying to get the exact right shot.  I think the crop maybe is a little close on top and bottom as we lose the extremes of the splash', '2009-02-26 23:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277119, 768158, 96881, '<td valign="top">Very different to anything else I have seen for this.  Yes, can see action but i think most people are after more montioned action in this challenge.  Lighting is quite harsh and the dark areas don''t help.  Congrats on going out on a limb though</td>', 'Very different to anything else I have seen for this.  Yes, can see action but i think most people are after more montioned action in this challenge.  Lighting is quite harsh and the dark areas don''t help.  Congrats on going out on a limb though', '2009-02-26 23:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277123, 767858, 96881, '<td valign="top">Noce bird shot.  Under advanced editing, maybe reducing the shaddow cast over the beak would have helped as it is distracting and draws attention.  Dodging the area to reduce it would have helped</td>', 'Noce bird shot.  Under advanced editing, maybe reducing the shaddow cast over the beak would have helped as it is distracting and draws attention.  Dodging the area to reduce it would have helped', '2009-02-26 23:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277128, 767221, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and like the colouors that go with jousting.  The crop is a little restrictive on the right and top for me.  I may have been tempted to just crop on the red horse, as he has much more interesting colours, and have portait orientation on this. This would have removed the dark ares on the right Selective desat on the crowd is a great way to get rid of the distracting elements from them and works really well.<br/>But great submission for the challenge</td>', 'Nice shot and like the colouors that go with jousting.  The crop is a little restrictive on the right and top for me.  I may have been tempted to just crop on the red horse, as he has much more interesting colours, and have portait orientation on this. This would have removed the dark ares on the right Selective desat on the crowd is a great way to get rid of the distracting elements from them and works really well.But great submission for the challenge', '2009-02-26 23:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277130, 767330, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the back of the biker is not that interesting.  Would have been great to photograph from the other side, so that we see his face instead.  Depth of field is pretty good.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the back of the biker is not that interesting.  Would have been great to photograph from the other side, so that we see his face instead.  Depth of field is pretty good.', '2009-02-26 23:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277133, 767955, 96881, '<td valign="top">Tell Wal that his posture sucks.  Straighten up.<br/> <br/>Still like this with teh feet above Wals head (nice jump Tony)<br/> <br/>Not Voting as I know the image</td>', 'Tell Wal that his posture sucks.  Straighten up. Still like this with teh feet above Wals head (nice jump Tony) Not Voting as I know the image', '2009-02-26 23:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277135, 767519, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great Action shot here.  Teh next couple if they fall out also would have been great.  the colours of this are great.  The red and yellow add to this photo.  The blurred background works really well to remove any distracting elements also</td>', 'Great Action shot here.  Teh next couple if they fall out also would have been great.  the colours of this are great.  The red and yellow add to this photo.  The blurred background works really well to remove any distracting elements also', '2009-02-26 23:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277136, 767900, 102505, '<td valign="top">Clear &amp; beautiful shot. But not a whole lot of ''action''</td>', 'Clear & beautiful shot. But not a whole lot of ''action''', '2009-02-26 23:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277138, 767663, 96881, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, and the shutter speed is spot on, giving the slightest blur ont he feet and hands.  However, he blends in too much to the surroundings.  The other players int eh shot don''t help.  With advanced editing, it would have been great if you could have made him stand out more from everything else, whether that was blurring some parts or something else.  A shallower depth of field in camera would have also helped as I can see too much detail int he wall etc.</td>', 'I like the idea, and the shutter speed is spot on, giving the slightest blur ont he feet and hands.  However, he blends in too much to the surroundings.  The other players int eh shot don''t help.  With advanced editing, it would have been great if you could have made him stand out more from everything else, whether that was blurring some parts or something else.  A shallower depth of field in camera would have also helped as I can see too much detail int he wall etc.', '2009-02-26 23:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277141, 768035, 96881, '<td valign="top">Way too blurred for me.  You need a faster shutter speed for action shots.  With a lot of inside areas being poorly lit, that also means changing the ISO to a higher level if possible</td>', 'Way too blurred for me.  You need a faster shutter speed for action shots.  With a lot of inside areas being poorly lit, that also means changing the ISO to a higher level if possible', '2009-02-26 23:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277144, 767872, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice capture here.  I think the crop on the sides is a little close, making a narrow picture.  a little extra room showing the foam water on each side would have helped this and just given it more space, without effecting how large he appears on teh screen</td>', 'Nice capture here.  I think the crop on the sides is a little close, making a narrow picture.  a little extra room showing the foam water on each side would have helped this and just given it more space, without effecting how large he appears on teh screen', '2009-02-26 23:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277146, 766494, 96881, '<td valign="top">Not for me.  Maybe in a motion blur photo, but not action.  Action ggenerally is about stopping something still, or almost, with the hint of movement.  Neither the idea or execution of this appeals to me.....<br/> <br/>Sorry</td>', 'Not for me.  Maybe in a motion blur photo, but not action.  Action ggenerally is about stopping something still, or almost, with the hint of movement.  Neither the idea or execution of this appeals to me..... Sorry', '2009-02-26 23:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277152, 767812, 96881, '<td valign="top">So, blake rode a winner in Sydney......<br/> <br/>I feel this needed some extra Post processing.  The colours seem a little boring. Upping the Contrast and a little bot of saturation make a big difference to this photo, as then the colours of the horse, the jockey and the surroundings have some punch.<br/>A shallower depth of field also would then have helped a little, and/or some blur int he background (we are in advanced editing for this one)<br/> <br/>The cature is good, but I don''t think you got the most out of it, and that will hurt your overall mark, aas this could have scored much better.</td>', 'So, blake rode a winner in Sydney...... I feel this needed some extra Post processing.  The colours seem a little boring. Upping the Contrast and a little bot of saturation make a big difference to this photo, as then the colours of the horse, the jockey and the surroundings have some punch.A shallower depth of field also would then have helped a little, and/or some blur int he background (we are in advanced editing for this one) The cature is good, but I don''t think you got the most out of it, and that will hurt your overall mark, aas this could have scored much better.', '2009-02-26 23:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277156, 768139, 96881, '<td valign="top">You missed him.<br/>Idea is good, but a shame you didn;t capture all of the rider.  Even if you were going for the entering the frame look, you needed his head to be in it, and not cropped at the top</td>', 'You missed him.Idea is good, but a shame you didn;t capture all of the rider.  Even if you were going for the entering the frame look, you needed his head to be in it, and not cropped at the top', '2009-02-26 23:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277157, 768116, 96881, '<td valign="top">I feel she is blending in too much with the background.  The black and white, while good, means she does not stand out enough against the surroundings for me.  The sky has blown out elements, while the dress probably should have been whiter.  Selective editing of these areas seperate would have helped, as we are under advanced editing rules</td>', 'I feel she is blending in too much with the background.  The black and white, while good, means she does not stand out enough against the surroundings for me.  The sky has blown out elements, while the dress probably should have been whiter.  Selective editing of these areas seperate would have helped, as we are under advanced editing rules', '2009-02-26 23:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277160, 768230, 96881, '<td valign="top">I love saturaation in photos, but I think you overdid it a little with this one.<br/>I would have been tempted to isolate the kid, and desaturate the rest of the photo (the background) to black and white, which would have made this photo really work.  A great capture but I think many will mark you down for the oversat......</td>', 'I love saturaation in photos, but I think you overdid it a little with this one.I would have been tempted to isolate the kid, and desaturate the rest of the photo (the background) to black and white, which would have made this photo really work.  A great capture but I think many will mark you down for the oversat......', '2009-02-26 23:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277162, 767328, 96881, '<td valign="top">Just doesn''t work for me, the wire int he way, the composition, the colours all needed improvements</td>', 'Just doesn''t work for me, the wire int he way, the composition, the colours all needed improvements', '2009-02-26 23:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277164, 767990, 96881, '<td valign="top">Photo is soft.  Board is overexposed which could have been selectively fixed in PP.  Would have preferred the ground on something else int he photo to give it context</td>', 'Photo is soft.  Board is overexposed which could have been selectively fixed in PP.  Would have preferred the ground on something else int he photo to give it context', '2009-02-26 23:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277170, 768034, 96881, '<td valign="top">Different, but this works.  Its sharp, its action, the crop for me is great.  Well done</td>', 'Different, but this works.  Its sharp, its action, the crop for me is great.  Well done', '2009-02-26 23:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277264, 768051, 49578, '<td valign="top">i love the minimalism and the colours here. oversharpened?</td>', 'i love the minimalism and the colours here. oversharpened?', '2009-02-27 01:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277298, 766492, 24486, '<td valign="top">I suggest increasing your ISO to try &amp; let a bit more light on to your cameras light sensor or possibly over exposing the shot if your camera has that function because it just seems a bit too dark. Alternativly you could try taking the photograph at a different time of the day when there is more light.</td>', 'I suggest increasing your ISO to try & let a bit more light on to your cameras light sensor or possibly over exposing the shot if your camera has that function because it just seems a bit too dark. Alternativly you could try taking the photograph at a different time of the day when there is more light.', '2009-02-27 03:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277304, 766594, 24486, '<td valign="top">Oh very clever, I really like this. It looks like you may have sunk the number one ball on the break too.</td>', 'Oh very clever, I really like this. It looks like you may have sunk the number one ball on the break too.', '2009-02-27 03:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5277305, 768035, 24486, '<td valign="top">Good concept. I suggest a faster shutter speed &amp; possibly positioning yourself in a position where you don''t capture that over head light which is blowing out that area of the photograph</td>', 'Good concept. I suggest a faster shutter speed & possibly positioning yourself in a position where you don''t capture that over head light which is blowing out that area of the photograph', '2009-02-27 03:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
