(5277979, 768185, 94437, '<td valign="top">Thats cool, If this was a one off lucky shot, then I am envious, if you set up and waited all day for this to fly over then well done, either way great shot.</td>', 'Thats cool, If this was a one off lucky shot, then I am envious, if you set up and waited all day for this to fly over then well done, either way great shot.', '2009-02-27 15:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278022, 768210, 42100, '<td valign="top">A great shot...what a joy this must have been.  Not only photographing this, but just witnessing horse and rider work so elegantly together in the snow!</td>', 'A great shot...what a joy this must have been.  Not only photographing this, but just witnessing horse and rider work so elegantly together in the snow!', '2009-02-27 16:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278033, 767584, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very cute pup...I think his spirit comes across very well in this photograph.  Any time you can put that little something extra into a photo that''s a good thing!</td>', 'Very cute pup...I think his spirit comes across very well in this photograph.  Any time you can put that little something extra into a photo that''s a good thing!', '2009-02-27 16:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278046, 768156, 42100, '<td valign="top">You used negative space quite nicely to balance rider and mountain below.  Wonderfully smooth gradient through the sky with a very nice rich but natural blue...nicely done!</td>', 'You used negative space quite nicely to balance rider and mountain below.  Wonderfully smooth gradient through the sky with a very nice rich but natural blue...nicely done!', '2009-02-27 16:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278049, 767811, 42100, '<td valign="top">The high-riding silhouette is well defined and really looks great soaring against that dramatic sunset...well done!  Also, the subtle detail of land give this photo a solid anchor.</td>', 'The high-riding silhouette is well defined and really looks great soaring against that dramatic sunset...well done!  Also, the subtle detail of land give this photo a solid anchor.', '2009-02-27 16:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278052, 768019, 42100, '<td valign="top">Some very nice light...its accenting all the details of the curling wave nicely.  The action of the body-boarder seems to get lost in the grandness of the wave.</td>', 'Some very nice light...its accenting all the details of the curling wave nicely.  The action of the body-boarder seems to get lost in the grandness of the wave.', '2009-02-27 16:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278054, 768053, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very clever and fun...please tell me the two of you didn''t really hangout underneath a moving train!?!  ;)</td>', 'Very clever and fun...please tell me the two of you didn''t really hangout underneath a moving train!?!  ;)', '2009-02-27 16:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278057, 766740, 42100, '<td valign="top">Fantastic detail in all of the ducks as they come in for a landing.  That dark backdrop really gives good pop to them all.  Well done!</td>', 'Fantastic detail in all of the ducks as they come in for a landing.  That dark backdrop really gives good pop to them all.  Well done!', '2009-02-27 16:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278058, 768232, 42100, '<td valign="top">The blur of the background does an excellent job of isolating and pronouncing the bike and rider...nicely done!</td>', 'The blur of the background does an excellent job of isolating and pronouncing the bike and rider...nicely done!', '2009-02-27 16:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278059, 768103, 42100, '<td valign="top">The backdrop of the land way below is what really gives this photo life and drama...a fantastic scene all around!</td>', 'The backdrop of the land way below is what really gives this photo life and drama...a fantastic scene all around!', '2009-02-27 16:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278065, 768069, 42100, '<td valign="top">You got me on this one...slightly offbeat composition, an old car and a general all around liveliness and a well blended uniqueness.  Great job!</td>', 'You got me on this one...slightly offbeat composition, an old car and a general all around liveliness and a well blended uniqueness.  Great job!', '2009-02-27 16:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278067, 768017, 42100, '<td valign="top">A fun and clever idea...but the cute expression by the wife completely upstages your photography! ;)</td>', 'A fun and clever idea...but the cute expression by the wife completely upstages your photography! ;)', '2009-02-27 16:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278069, 768251, 42100, '<td valign="top">This is like an explosion of color...fun and lively.  Very nice!</td>', 'This is like an explosion of color...fun and lively.  Very nice!', '2009-02-27 16:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278075, 767958, 42100, '<td valign="top">The cross-process works well for this photo...all the tones are just right.  The clouds add a very nice drama, but not so much as to take away from the action.  Nicely done!</td>', 'The cross-process works well for this photo...all the tones are just right.  The clouds add a very nice drama, but not so much as to take away from the action.  Nicely done!', '2009-02-27 16:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278344, 768181, 99981, '<td valign="top">Great composition and choice of B&amp;W.</td>', 'Great composition and choice of B&W.', '2009-02-27 18:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278350, 768166, 99981, '<td valign="top">I like the way this shot meets the challenge, and them both being dressed with blue helped the composition in my opinion. I just think that the colors aren''t strong enough, which can be fixed with some PP. The big problem is that your shot is really OOF. Maybe with some good colors and a good focus you would get some points from me! Good luck.</td>', 'I like the way this shot meets the challenge, and them both being dressed with blue helped the composition in my opinion. I just think that the colors aren''t strong enough, which can be fixed with some PP. The big problem is that your shot is really OOF. Maybe with some good colors and a good focus you would get some points from me! Good luck.', '2009-02-27 18:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278354, 767033, 99981, '<td valign="top">I would like to see it from another perspective, with less players at the back which are kind of distracting for me. This perspective also didn''t make me see the ball instantaneally, which would be cool. I see a nice focus and a good catch there though! Good luck!</td>', 'I would like to see it from another perspective, with less players at the back which are kind of distracting for me. This perspective also didn''t make me see the ball instantaneally, which would be cool. I see a nice focus and a good catch there though! Good luck!', '2009-02-27 18:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278357, 766506, 99981, '<td valign="top">Great shot! The light is great!</td>', 'Great shot! The light is great!', '2009-02-27 18:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278365, 766493, 99981, '<td valign="top">I understand your intention of creating a Action impression with the closets closing (this is what i thought) but the effect of motion blur in this shot didn''t get me so much, maybe because the object is just a closet. The white part at the right top is distracting, but i like the orange. I''m sorry if i was rude, it''s just my opinion. Good luck, bye.</td>', 'I understand your intention of creating a Action impression with the closets closing (this is what i thought) but the effect of motion blur in this shot didn''t get me so much, maybe because the object is just a closet. The white part at the right top is distracting, but i like the orange. I''m sorry if i was rude, it''s just my opinion. Good luck, bye.', '2009-02-27 18:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278376, 768204, 92512, '<td valign="top">Would make a good postcard. very good shot</td>', 'Would make a good postcard. very good shot', '2009-02-27 19:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278378, 767450, 92512, '<td valign="top">Good shoot, I would have to have seen the height factor</td>', 'Good shoot, I would have to have seen the height factor', '2009-02-27 19:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5278379, 767221, 92512, '<td valign="top">I want to learn how to do this. I always like this editing effect. It really works well here.</td>', 'I want to learn how to do this. I always like this editing effect. It really works well here.', '2009-02-27 19:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
