(5279928, 767957, 15407, '<td valign="top">Like to see the shooting data as these are the ''subjects'' I enjoy taking photos of.  Looks like you had some decent,but not optimum lighting and a good point to pan from~to... What I think might work well here is using a monopod (required here around any trackside photo locations (Infineon) and a shutter of about 1/80 and closed down to get that speed... In any event Its great action and some more motion blur with the sponsors showing is real desireable.</td>', 'Like to see the shooting data as these are the ''subjects'' I enjoy taking photos of.  Looks like you had some decent,but not optimum lighting and a good point to pan from~to... What I think might work well here is using a monopod (required here around any trackside photo locations (Infineon) and a shutter of about 1/80 and closed down to get that speed... In any event Its great action and some more motion blur with the sponsors showing is real desireable.', '2009-02-28 23:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
