(5281366, 768066, 88136, '<td valign="top">im not exactly fond of the way the man is walking out of the photo, but overall i do like this photo. the mountains are very beautiful, not sure i like the boot prints in the snow. they seem to take away from the pristine nature of the scene</td>', 'im not exactly fond of the way the man is walking out of the photo, but overall i do like this photo. the mountains are very beautiful, not sure i like the boot prints in the snow. they seem to take away from the pristine nature of the scene', '2009-03-01 15:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
