(5281378, 768012, 88136, '<td valign="top">exciting photo. must have been interesting avoiding wood particles hiting your lens, unless you just dropped them into the photo. i like the expression and the position of the man, but his hat is kinda distracting. the logo stands out and takes away from the rest of the photo</td>', 'exciting photo. must have been interesting avoiding wood particles hiting your lens, unless you just dropped them into the photo. i like the expression and the position of the man, but his hat is kinda distracting. the logo stands out and takes away from the rest of the photo', '2009-03-01 15:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
