(5282728, 767500, 76430, '<td valign="top">Wow, how did you get this shot? Really the right place at the right time.  Minor technical issues like the post behind the plane and not a very attractive foreground or background, but hey, whatcha gonna do?  There''s no re-shooting this one.  Newspaper front page photo.</td>', 'Wow, how did you get this shot? Really the right place at the right time.  Minor technical issues like the post behind the plane and not a very attractive foreground or background, but hey, whatcha gonna do?  There''s no re-shooting this one.  Newspaper front page photo.', '2009-03-02 01:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5282746, 766594, 76430, '<td valign="top">Looks like a re-shoot of one last week, but that one knew how to rack the balls.  However I like the extreme wide angle and effect of the time exposure.  Not voting.</td>', 'Looks like a re-shoot of one last week, but that one knew how to rack the balls.  However I like the extreme wide angle and effect of the time exposure.  Not voting.', '2009-03-02 01:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
