(5282899, 768065, 30364, '<td valign="top">Easily the best.  How could there be a better ''action'' photograph than this great picture of some kids delighting in the pure joy of movement for the sake of it?  Not going anywhere; not doing some tedious bloody sport; just jumping because it''s the most wonderful fun-to-be-alive thing for a group of young friends to do.  The fact that it''s happening before this sombre institutional backdrop makes it all the more wonderful.  10.  And an Order of the Thumb:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=748778" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Easily the best.  How could there be a better ''action'' photograph than this great picture of some kids delighting in the pure joy of movement for the sake of it?  Not going anywhere; not doing some tedious bloody sport; just jumping because it''s the most wonderful fun-to-be-alive thing for a group of young friends to do.  The fact that it''s happening before this sombre institutional backdrop makes it all the more wonderful.  10.  And an Order of the Thumb:', '2009-03-02 04:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
