(5283955, 767068, 99981, '<td valign="top">Hi, in my opinion this image is OOF, but the great light makes it look like some effect or something (everything looks really soft), but stills OOF. The ocean(?) at the background is not distracting for me, and i think you got good catch of moment. And i just think that the way the dog is don''t show me much ACTION, but inert! I''m sorry if i was rude in any way. Good luck!</td>', 'Hi, in my opinion this image is OOF, but the great light makes it look like some effect or something (everything looks really soft), but stills OOF. The ocean(?) at the background is not distracting for me, and i think you got good catch of moment. And i just think that the way the dog is don''t show me much ACTION, but inert! I''m sorry if i was rude in any way. Good luck!', '2009-03-02 13:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
