(5284441, 768177, 51747, '<td valign="top">I think all kids want to do this. Very nice capture. Just a little on the dark side.</td>', 'I think all kids want to do this. Very nice capture. Just a little on the dark side.', '2009-03-02 17:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
