(5284574, 768151, 75585, '<td valign="top">My only "huh?" on this photo is that it appears he is not sledding but more jumping in the air with the disk - there is no slope that has given him air.  Still love this though!</td>', 'My only "huh?" on this photo is that it appears he is not sledding but more jumping in the air with the disk - there is no slope that has given him air.  Still love this though!', '2009-03-02 19:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
