(5285553, 767548, 99506, '<td valign="top">Nice work, I love the use of the intersting arrow, it works so much better than the skewer lol</td>', 'Nice work, I love the use of the intersting arrow, it works so much better than the skewer lol', '2009-03-03 10:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5285555, 768100, 99506, '<td valign="top">Great framing.</td>', 'Great framing.', '2009-03-03 10:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5285556, 766954, 99506, '<td valign="top">You have frozen the surfer perfectly and I love the flatness of the wave just before it curls, great work</td>', 'You have frozen the surfer perfectly and I love the flatness of the wave just before it curls, great work', '2009-03-03 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5285557, 767865, 99506, '<td valign="top">lol the dog look crazy</td>', 'lol the dog look crazy', '2009-03-03 10:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5285613, 767684, 79816, '<td valign="top">Love that face!</td>', 'Love that face!', '2009-03-03 12:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5285680, 768041, 99981, '<td valign="top">Hi. I really liked the title, it''s really funny and the photo says everything! The choice of object was cool too, but it think that you could chose one of this many things happening in this photo to shoot it. The BIG thing of this shot is the referee looking at the little girl getting the ball. But there are many distracting things happening at the same time. I''m not a fan of the focus too, it seems a little of. <br/>Nice colors and great catch! Sorry if i was rude in anyway and sorry about my english! <br/>Good luck!</td>', 'Hi. I really liked the title, it''s really funny and the photo says everything! The choice of object was cool too, but it think that you could chose one of this many things happening in this photo to shoot it. The BIG thing of this shot is the referee looking at the little girl getting the ball. But there are many distracting things happening at the same time. I''m not a fan of the focus too, it seems a little of. Nice colors and great catch! Sorry if i was rude in anyway and sorry about my english! Good luck!', '2009-03-03 13:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5285685, 767870, 99981, '<td valign="top">Their faces are great! You had a good feeling to get this moment! I just think that those people at the top are really distracting. With some cropping you would have a much better shot in my opinion! Good luck!</td>', 'Their faces are great! You had a good feeling to get this moment! I just think that those people at the top are really distracting. With some cropping you would have a much better shot in my opinion! Good luck!', '2009-03-03 13:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5285687, 767961, 99981, '<td valign="top">This blurry effect didn''t work much for me. I think it''s oof and the girl''s face is not very realistic. I think you had a good idea and with some tweaking it could be better in my opinion! Good luck and sorry if i was rude!</td>', 'This blurry effect didn''t work much for me. I think it''s oof and the girl''s face is not very realistic. I think you had a good idea and with some tweaking it could be better in my opinion! Good luck and sorry if i was rude!', '2009-03-03 13:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5285691, 768243, 99981, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, i like the effect but i think it made the shot look too artificial, and the girl''s look didn''t convince me too. I love the green and the idea though! Sorry if i was rude!</td>', 'I''m sorry, i like the effect but i think it made the shot look too artificial, and the girl''s look didn''t convince me too. I love the green and the idea though! Sorry if i was rude!', '2009-03-03 13:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5285692, 768197, 99981, '<td valign="top">Good choice of colors! I would like to see the person from another perspective, but you have a nice shot there.</td>', 'Good choice of colors! I would like to see the person from another perspective, but you have a nice shot there.', '2009-03-03 13:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5285694, 768266, 99981, '<td valign="top">Well, i would like to see it without the B&amp;W and with a different crop, because you got a good moment there. Nice shot though!</td>', 'Well, i would like to see it without the B&W and with a different crop, because you got a good moment there. Nice shot though!', '2009-03-03 13:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5285695, 767858, 99981, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light!</td>', 'Beautiful light!', '2009-03-03 13:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5285696, 767447, 99981, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of the effect but i love the shot! Nice catch! 6</td>', 'I''m not a fan of the effect but i love the shot! Nice catch! 6', '2009-03-03 13:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5285697, 767731, 99981, '<td valign="top">I think this effect is beautiful, and it made the colors of your shot look better! Love the idea of making action on something that don''t move. I just think you could have cropped the upper part and i don''t see much relation of the lights with the rose, except for their colors. I''m giving you a 6. Nice shot!</td>', 'I think this effect is beautiful, and it made the colors of your shot look better! Love the idea of making action on something that don''t move. I just think you could have cropped the upper part and i don''t see much relation of the lights with the rose, except for their colors. I''m giving you a 6. Nice shot!', '2009-03-03 13:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5285698, 768034, 99981, '<td valign="top">I hope the upper left don''t take any points from you because it''s OOF, kind of blurry. This image is one of the bests in the "meeting challenge" aspect and i really like the colors. Hope they were playing. Good luck!</td>', 'I hope the upper left don''t take any points from you because it''s OOF, kind of blurry. This image is one of the bests in the "meeting challenge" aspect and i really like the colors. Hope they were playing. Good luck!', '2009-03-03 13:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
