(5285951, 767731, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the idea a lot. I would have liked the rose to be sharper with all of the blur around it. Also, the light in the foreground seems very heavy. The whole picture didn''t fit on my screen, so I had to scroll. I liked the top part very much, but was disappointed when I hit the bottom part. It seemed to overwhelm the rest of the picture. Fun idea, interesting colors.</td>', 'I like the idea a lot. I would have liked the rose to be sharper with all of the blur around it. Also, the light in the foreground seems very heavy. The whole picture didn''t fit on my screen, so I had to scroll. I liked the top part very much, but was disappointed when I hit the bottom part. It seemed to overwhelm the rest of the picture. Fun idea, interesting colors.', '2009-03-03 16:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
