(5285955, 768206, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the shot. It''s too bad that the houses clutter it up so much--but I guess there''s not much you can do about that!</td>', 'I like the shot. It''s too bad that the houses clutter it up so much--but I guess there''s not much you can do about that!', '2009-03-03 16:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
