(5285959, 768167, 84668, '<td valign="top">I doubt it will score high since voters will expect more radical sport photos. Anyway I like this one so much, the contrast and lighting looks perfect to my taste. I''m upgrading it to 9 now.</td>', 'I doubt it will score high since voters will expect more radical sport photos. Anyway I like this one so much, the contrast and lighting looks perfect to my taste. I''m upgrading it to 9 now.', '2009-03-03 16:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
