(5285971, 768138, 84668, '<td valign="top">I don''t see anything good on this despite of the idea. The idea is good but not well executed. Hope other voters score you higher than me, but being sincere, I gave it a 1.</td>', 'I don''t see anything good on this despite of the idea. The idea is good but not well executed. Hope other voters score you higher than me, but being sincere, I gave it a 1.', '2009-03-03 16:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
