(5286054, 768065, 23430, '<td valign="top">It''s great how the kids stand out against the drab background. They look like they''re having fun too.</td>', 'It''s great how the kids stand out against the drab background. They look like they''re having fun too.', '2009-03-03 17:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5286135, 767531, 103142, '<td valign="top">It''s very difficult to get basketball shots because of the indoor lighting and close space. It''s a little strange having it cropped right at her ankles, and I think it would have been stronger either including the whole person on the right, or cropping her out. Also, the shadow from the flash on the ball is distracting. Might want to consider a faster lens and high ISO to avoid flash.</td>', 'It''s very difficult to get basketball shots because of the indoor lighting and close space. It''s a little strange having it cropped right at her ankles, and I think it would have been stronger either including the whole person on the right, or cropping her out. Also, the shadow from the flash on the ball is distracting. Might want to consider a faster lens and high ISO to avoid flash.', '2009-03-03 18:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5286136, 768204, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the fountains. I''d be tempted to either straighten the horizon (notice the water line) or tilt it a little more. Just a small amount of tilt looks a little unbalanced.</td>', 'I like the fountains. I''d be tempted to either straighten the horizon (notice the water line) or tilt it a little more. Just a small amount of tilt looks a little unbalanced.', '2009-03-03 18:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5286137, 768208, 103142, '<td valign="top">It''s a fun shot, and I enjoyed it a lot. Small thing, I like the blur on the ball, but if this was a set-up shot, I''d prefer not blur on the person. If this was just a lucky catch, nice job.</td>', 'It''s a fun shot, and I enjoyed it a lot. Small thing, I like the blur on the ball, but if this was a set-up shot, I''d prefer not blur on the person. If this was just a lucky catch, nice job.', '2009-03-03 18:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5286138, 767172, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Very small suggestion, I might crop it in from the left a bit--my eyes roved over there, and there wasn''t much to see. I absolutely love the shadow on the e!</td>', 'Nice shot. Very small suggestion, I might crop it in from the left a bit--my eyes roved over there, and there wasn''t much to see. I absolutely love the shadow on the e!', '2009-03-03 18:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
