(5286140, 767097, 103142, '<td valign="top">What a funny looking animal! The blur on the background is kind of distracting. If there wasn''t enough light, I might have tried even slower shutter speed and panning more to make it even more blurred. It''s close enough to in focus to make your eyes want to try to resolve it.</td>', 'What a funny looking animal! The blur on the background is kind of distracting. If there wasn''t enough light, I might have tried even slower shutter speed and panning more to make it even more blurred. It''s close enough to in focus to make your eyes want to try to resolve it.', '2009-03-03 18:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
