(5374750, 768158, 83313, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by maynerd12:</b></div><hr/><i> If there was a ribbon for most humorous... </i></td></tr></table> <br/>There is, but since I didn''t vote in the action shot challenge, I missed this at the time. LOTS of action going on here. Please accept a belated shoehorn award for injecting humor into a non-humorous challenge.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=737193" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737193.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737193.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/83313/120/737193.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Originally posted by maynerd12: If there was a ribbon for most humorous...  There is, but since I didn''t vote in the action shot challenge, I missed this at the time. LOTS of action going on here. Please accept a belated shoehorn award for injecting humor into a non-humorous challenge.', '2009-03-16 14:07:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5378906, 767881, 67145, '<td valign="top">THIS IS AWESOME ..!!<br/>a fantastic action shot and a fantastic subject ... it can take quite a few shots to get one that''s just right .. with our little katee, if the focus is exactly where you want it then her mouth''s all skew .. or you get the back legs and not the eyes in focus .. they run so fast .. i''m not sure how fast your camera can focus with that lens but you''ve got the most brilliant shot here .. her concentration is excellent .. love the way her legs are placed .. the front ones showing speed and the back ones make me laugh .. she''s a beautiful looking animal and very very photogenic .. :)</td>', 'THIS IS AWESOME ..!!a fantastic action shot and a fantastic subject ... it can take quite a few shots to get one that''s just right .. with our little katee, if the focus is exactly where you want it then her mouth''s all skew .. or you get the back legs and not the eyes in focus .. they run so fast .. i''m not sure how fast your camera can focus with that lens but you''ve got the most brilliant shot here .. her concentration is excellent .. love the way her legs are placed .. the front ones showing speed and the back ones make me laugh .. she''s a beautiful looking animal and very very photogenic .. :)', '2009-03-16 23:14:34.000000', NULL, 0),
